  "zh": "环几何耦合的组装机器 B2：**第 k 阶谐波只连 |m − m′| = k，只给 k = 0 时块间逐位为零**",
  "en": "The toroidal coupling machinery B2: order k links only |m − m′| = k, and with only k = 0 the blocks are exactly decoupled"
 },
